": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499304305_1327505932765311_5286460740341237931_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Z0yuu8Jgup4Q7kNvwGij3YQ&_nc_oc=Ado2ihdZCcr0acROkPy6TFd8IeguzbEsJzidn0SMh79NNW6imyJb0p2wOGXIEEtyiUA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHn9kMhIbcYfpCDSK-BN11MCWDWmd1b4gJ82eqT2R1seg&oe=6A771DE4"}, {"file_name": "Untitled (33).png", "id": "2076724189787348", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499304938_2076724193120681_4871879008737988130_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=YXMx0u6P8gAQ7kNvwGRAg0W&_nc_oc=Ado-WpqN_XknqnzYHGvZFrV1TlOx_jdHgVzGayRAUurYFd6SwE7_dVlEu13BdLK-ZxA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEqlX2REvM7qywuHEWWej4oq2GuNyIMFUUxStSMx6clFg&oe=6A773157"}, {"file_name": "HighresScreenshot00033.png", "id": "3932380693732122", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499304938_3932380697065455_5087597325838508038_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=w009kxmqL4MQ7kNvwHewWtd&_nc_oc=AdptB2ntGHt_vZl0O14Ha064_OS1Zki7LNEaDrusXMYp49Y3kwqLE61NiWVWmFk5IsU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHdXN_WNKAD-QCv7BjSvUDHXixjG9pi7H1MpYx1EQWI9A&oe=6A771022"}, {"file_name": "Untitled (34).png", "id": "890620570035576", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499303140_890620573368909_3665044860292886222_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=qs-N9LHhJHAQ7kNvwFyXNIb&_nc_oc=AdpZFX_utkorSF1pDyswOapR4w-jGZEyVOv0-Y4zhMQxsjME5fu6gvyusidnpgF4ufc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGjjPGyzHuJhsGJEvWNkgKYhLGds4LA78SCyD4BfQNHLA&oe=6A770B1B"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Zbonk_LakeHouse_2560x1440.png", "id": "1547163436915760", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825305_1547163440249093_3018434286459742065_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=pYFyMbIbgQgQ7kNvwESttEn&_nc_oc=AdpRfRqN53u-KXqe4K81xQohk0Jnnl1i5jeXo8hsPEchPDRchIEave8vRQtj9fz3Xds&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGDc_AkYRpcqBn38S46ofIrc3iHzd6p95tqc7XzlxK6uA&oe=6A7726F9"}, "display_name": "ZOMBONK", "keywords": ["zombie", "gun", "shooting", "multiplayer", "monke"], "long_description": "# Bonker wake up. World gone. Whatever.\n\nZombies and monsters everywhere. Bonker still vibing. \ud83d\ude0e\ud83e\udddf\u200d\u2642\ufe0f\n\nExplore maps, crack open boxes, hunt for gear, survive long enough to flex it.\n\nLoot stuff \u2192 Sell stuff \u2192 Get Bonk$ \u2192 Buy drip. \n\n# Multiple maps to choose from:\n- \ud83c\udfd9\ufe0f Bonktopia City - open, quiet, and NOT SAFE\n- \ud83e\udddf Zombie Survival - relentless waves, COD zombies vibes\n- \ud83c\udfeb School - three levels. too many footsteps.\n- \ud83d\udef0\ufe0f Space - out it the orbit, something broke into the station\n- \ud83d\udca3 War - they started it, you end it\n- \ud83d\udc1bNest - what lies underground will shock you\n- \ud83c\udffaTemple - explore the secrets of the civilizations before bonkers\n- \ud83c\udfaa Bonkland - horror carnival with dark rooms, laser pathways, & targets everywhere.\n- \ud83c\udd99 Skybonk - an Only Up inspired parkour map, with zombies of course\n\nPro Tip: Bonk with friends for more loot and more BONK$. \n\nPlay in private servers or chill in the Social Hub safe zone to hang with fellow Bonkers.\n\n**\ud83e\udd1d Come hang in discord, and meet our bonker community \ud83d\udc49 discord.gg/zbvr**\n", "short_description": "Survive the zombie apocalypse, loot for guns and items!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.sinnstudio.com/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://www.sinnstudio.com/terms-of-service", "publisher_name": "Sinn Studio Inc.", "support_website_url": "https://www.sinnstudio.com/contact", "website_url": "https://www.sinnstudio.com/", "category": null, "comfort_r